rces><source category="A"  name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-10200555-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>10200555</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="X" name="SEA"  created-by-npl="N"/></sources> </patcit><patcit ucid="JP-9044354-A"  status="new"><document-id status="new"  format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>9044354</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id> <sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources> </patcit> <patcit ucid="JP-9261550-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>9261550</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1085770A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAWAMURA HARUMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SATO MASAHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SONY CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWAMURA, HARUMI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SATO, MASAHIKO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SONY CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAWAMURA HARUMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SATO MASAHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWAMURA, HARUMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SATO, MASAHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>It is possible to easily and quickly deal with a failure of a specific device in a system where devices are connected using a bus having a digital interface.  An electronic device comprises means (12, 23) adaptive to a predetermined digital interface where a predetermined identification code, a code for detecting an object to be processed, a code for specifying the class of processing, and information for conducting a processing and used for recognizing the identification code, means (14, 22) for detecting the object when the identification code is recognized, processing means (16 to 19, 24, 25) for executing the information for carrying out the processing according to the processing class if the object includes the electronic device, whereby the device that has failed can be specifically detected and repaired easily.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>On peut aisément et rapidement traiter une défaillance d'un dispositif spécifique dans un système dans lequel les dispositifs sont reliés par un bus ayant une interface numérique. Un dispositif électronique comprend des moyens (12, 23) conçus pour une interface numérique prédéterminée dans laquelle un code d'identification prédéterminé, un code de détection de l'objet à traiter, un code spécifiant le type de traitement, et des informations sur la conduite du traitement sont utilisés pour reconnaître le code d'identification; des moyens (14, 22) de détection de l'objet une fois le code d'identification reconnu; des moyens (16 à 19, 24, 25) d'exécution des informations du traitement en fonction du type de traitement dans le cas où l'objet comprend le dispositif électronique. Le dispositif, qui a eu des défaillances, peut alors être spécifiquement détecté et aisément réparé.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>